n't have to fight but you  can if you want to rest at the side of  grace at the top of the stairs and  present the medallion at the end of the  room here you'll gain access to the  mountaintops you can make your way  through this area just progressing along  normally there's a frost dragon that you  can or can't fight depending on what you  want to do if you want to just get to  the sword you can run right past them  but you will progress normally until you  reach an area called flames peak at the  top of this hill you will see a church  where on approach you will trigger an  invasion once you beat this samurai guy  you'll earn the rivers of blood katana  and can use the blood weapon art that  just looks so freaking awesome again  you'll need some points into dexterity  strength and a lot of points into arcane  which i didn't put any points into but i  now will so i can eventually use this  item but i love it it looks super sick  and i hope you guys enjoy it i also hope  you enjoyed the video so make sure to  like comment and subscribe if you want  to see more videos like this in the  future and stop by the twitch streams  where we'll be streaming eldon ring  every single day everything's linked  down in the description thanks for  watching and i'll see you in the next  one
 

